<form action="/rnode/<%= host %>/<%= port %>/login" method="post" target="_blank">
  <input type="hidden" name="password" value="<%= password %>">
  <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Connect to VS Code</button>
</form>
<p class="text-muted small mt-2 mb-0">Extensions and settings you add are kept in your home folder for next time.
Run heavy work with <code>sbatch</code> from VS Code's terminal instead of inside an editor-only session.</p>
